<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies four issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies four issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said it has qualified for bond insurance the following four municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Etowah County Board of Education, Ala., $10.7 million special tax bonds.</p>
<p>--Centerpoint School District #43, Ariz., $500,000 consolidated bonds.</p>
<p>--Clark County School District, Nev., $300 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--Fonda-Fultonville School District, N.Y., $1.8 million of shool district bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
